// operation reading a component the paired vector operation writes got the NEW value. 165 of the 3740 pack shaders have such an
// instruction (scan_coissue.py); 159 are re-translated with the order fixed (make_coissue_overrides.py: the v41 control reproduces
// each device module byte for byte, the patched HLSL differs only in line order). GTA V's far-ocean fill water#20p took its fog
// amount from a reflection vector component instead of the fog integral: an unfogged dark-blue band at the horizon (F7). The 6 keys
