    // ---- v158: 2x frame interpolation (opt-in, diagnostic: files/private-trace/diag-generic-frame-interp, read at start) ----
    // After each present's blit, the frame is copied into a ping-pong pair of storage images and five compute passes
    // (local-analysis/frame-interp/fi_*.comp) make the frame halfway between it and the previous one: quarter-res luma,
    // coarse block matching (+-12 quarter-res px), full-res refinement (+-3 px), 3x3 vector median, motion-compensated
