    // applied: the files v458 reads and prewarms from (pipeline-recipes-NN.bin) never receive one, so a boot at the default
    // after a run at a scale reads, decodes and prewarms exactly what it would have without that run. (At a scale the recipes
    // WITHOUT the bit still go to the normal files: they are the pipelines the default uses too.)
