    // which exchanges those two members with the other set's (rsRecipeFile / rsRecipeFileBytes) when the recipe belongs to the
    // set that is not selected, and sets the name tag ("" or "scaled-"). At 16 no recipe has PsScaled: one comparison, nothing
    // exchanged, the tag stays "" and the path is v458's. (An earlier form that rewrote recordRecipe's arithmetic through
    // pointers cost Renderer::pipeline, into which recordRecipe is inlined, its profile record: review finding.)
