    // while draining the renderer, whose worker waited for rendererMutex). takeWritebackBatch() runs under rendererMutex
    // and only moves the completed list out; publishWritebackBatch() writes guest memory WITHOUT rendererMutex (it
    // touches `writer`, set once at initialization, wbLogged, which only this path reads, and its own result);
    // mergeWritebackResult() adds the counters and notes under rendererMutex again. The writes are a completion
